    "media:imagetext": "CHAMPAGNE AND WINES\nSparkling Wine\nKupferberg Sekt\nWhite\nMountain Heights Chardonnay\nRed\nBessière Syrah Vins de Pays D'Oc\nSPIRITS AND LIQUEURS\nVodka Martini Finlandia Vodka\nSmirnoff Vodka Tanqueray Gin\nBacardi Rum Maker's Mark Bourbon\nCrown Royal Dewar's Scotch\nJohnnie Walker Black Label Scotch\nGlenmorangie Single Malt Scotch\nJack Daniel's Tennessee Sour Mash Whiskey\nCanadian Club Classic Whisky\nCourvoisier V.S.O.P. Cognac Grand Marnier\nDi Saronno Amaretto Baileys Irish Cream\nKahlúa Drambuie Campari\nHarvey's Bristol Cream Sherry\nBEER AND OTHER BEVERAGES\nAmerican and Regional Beer\nA variety of Nonalcoholic Beverages including\nCaribou Coffee, Soda and Fruit Juice\nTazo Tea including Earl Grey\nand Wild Sweet Orange\nDELTA AIR LINES\nwelcomes you aboard\nSALAD\nSpring Salad served with French Dressing\nENTREES\nPlease choose one of the following Entrees\nSteakhouse Selection\nThe following Entree features a recipe\nspecially designed for Delta Air Lines\nOmaha Steaks® grilled Tenderloin\naccented by Provençale Sauce,\nserved with Broccoli, Carrots\nand a Baked Potato with Cheese\nSouthwest Chicken\nCajun Chicken Breast\nenhanced by Red Bell Pepper Sauce,\noffered with a Southwest Vegetable Mix\nand Tomato Risotto\ntopped with Mozzarella Cheese\nRoll and Butter\nCheese and Crackers\nDESSERT\nMocha Madness Cake Chocolate\nGOOD MORNING\nOrange Juice Fruit\nCereal Bar\nEgg, Turkey-Ham and Cheese\nserved on a Biscuit\nPlease accept our apology if your selection\nis not available\n310Y005-B",
